<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Systems Board · Knee Recovery Training Plan</title>
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Knee Plan">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#17202B">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@500;600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#EEF1F4;
    --card:#FFFFFF;
    --ink:#17202B;
    --ink-soft:#4B5866;
    --line:#D6DDE4;
    --blue:#2456E6;
    --blue-soft:#E4EBFD;
    --green:#1E8A5A;
    --green-soft:#E2F3EA;
    --amber:#B87A0E;
    --amber-soft:#FBF0DA;
    --red:#C43D3D;
    --red-soft:#FBE7E7;
    --mono:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    --disp:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;
    --body:'Public Sans',sans-serif;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 16px 72px}

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  header{border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:26px}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
  h1{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,52px);line-height:1.02;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.01em;margin:6px 0 10px}
  .meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 22px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .meta b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  h2{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:26px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em;margin:38px 0 4px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}
  h2 .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;text-transform:uppercase;transform:translateY(-3px)}
  .p1 .tag{background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue)}
  .p2 .tag{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber)}
  .p3 .tag{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green)}
  .sub{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:14px;max-width:60ch}

  /* ---------- session clock ---------- */
  .clock{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 18px 14px;margin:18px 0 6px}
  .clock h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:19px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-bottom:12px}
  .bar{display:flex;height:44px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;font-family:var(--mono)}
  .seg{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0 8px;color:#fff;min-width:0}
  .seg span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.85;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .seg b{font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap}
  .ticks{display:flex;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:5px}
  .ticks div{text-align:left}

  /* ---------- legend ---------- */
  .legend{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:16px 0}
  .lg{border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px}
  .lg h4{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}
  .lg.ok{background:var(--green-soft)} .lg.ok h4{color:var(--green)}
  .lg.cau{background:var(--amber-soft)} .lg.cau h4{color:var(--amber)}
  .lg.no{background:var(--red-soft)} .lg.no h4{color:var(--red)}

  /* ---------- drill tables ---------- */
  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin:14px 0}
  .card-h{padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .card-h h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:19px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em}
  .card-h .freq{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px}
  th{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:left;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:600;background:#FAFBFC}
  td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
  tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  td.num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:500}
  td .note{display:block;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}
  .knee{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-top:4px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .knee.ok{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green)}
  .knee.cau{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber)}

  /* ---------- rules ---------- */
  .rules{background:var(--ink);color:#E9EEF3;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 20px 16px;margin-top:34px}
  .rules h2{color:#fff;margin:0 0 12px}
  .rules ol{list-style:none;counter-reset:r}
  .rules li{counter-increment:r;display:flex;gap:14px;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);font-size:13.5px}
  .rules li::before{content:counter(r,decimal-leading-zero);font-family:var(--mono);color:#8FB0FF;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding-top:1px}
  .rules b{color:#fff}

  /* ---------- movement key ---------- */
  .movekey{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:16px 0 6px}
  .mk{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 10px 8px;text-align:center}
  .mk svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  .mk h5{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:15px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-top:4px}
  .mk .stat{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-top:3px}
  .mk .stat.ok{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green)}
  .mk .stat.cau{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber)}
  .mk .stat.no{background:var(--red-soft);color:var(--red)}
  .fig{stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;fill:none}
  .fig-acc{stroke:var(--blue);stroke-width:4.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;fill:none}
  .hold{fill:var(--line)}
  .head{fill:var(--ink)}

  /* ---------- weekly layout ---------- */
  .week{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:6px;margin:14px 0 4px}
  .day{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 6px;text-align:center;min-width:0}
  .day h6{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}
  .day .act{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.15;border-radius:5px;padding:6px 2px}
  .day .act small{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:8.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-top:2px;text-transform:none}
  .act.climb-a{background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue)}
  .act.climb-b{background:#EFE7FB;color:#7A4FD1}
  .act.bike{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber)}
  .act.rest{background:#F0F2F5;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .act[data-target]{cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  .act[data-target]:active{opacity:.75}
  #ride1,#ride2,#ride3,#endurance,#phase1,#phase2,#phase3{scroll-margin-top:12px}
  .day.today{border:2px solid var(--blue);padding:7px 5px}
  .day.today h6{color:var(--blue)}

  /* ---------- plan start / week badge ---------- */
  .start-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:0 0 12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .start-row label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
  .start-row input{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 9px;font-family:var(--body);font-size:13px;background:#FAFBFC;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;height:36px;min-width:0}
  .start-row .wkbadge{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:5px;white-space:nowrap}

  /* ---------- rest timer ---------- */
  .t-timer{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline dotted;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  #timerbar{position:fixed;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:14px;max-width:836px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 18px;display:none;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-family:var(--mono);z-index:50;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(23,32,43,.3);cursor:pointer}
  #timerbar.on{display:flex}
  #timerbar.done{background:var(--green)}
  #timerbar b{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em}
  #timerbar span{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.8}
  @media (max-width:560px){.week{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.week .day:nth-child(n+5){grid-column:span 1}}

  /* ---------- collapsible sections ---------- */
  details.sec>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  details.sec>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  details.sec>summary h2{user-select:none}
  details.sec>summary h2::after{content:'+';margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:22px;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-soft);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  details.sec[open]>summary h2::after{content:'\2013'}
  details.sec>summary:hover h2::after{color:var(--blue)}

  /* ---------- session log ---------- */
  .log{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}
  .log-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
  .lf{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0}
  .lf label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
  .lf input[type=date],.lf textarea{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:9px 10px;font-family:var(--body);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);background:#FAFBFC;width:100%}
  .lf input[type=date]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;min-width:0;height:41px;text-align:left;display:block;-webkit-text-align:left}
  .lf input[type=date]::-webkit-date-and-time-value{text-align:left;margin:0}
  .lf textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:56px}
  .lf.full{grid-column:1 / -1}
  .seg-btns{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .seg-btns button{flex:1;min-width:72px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#FAFBFC;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 4px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
  .seg-btns button.on{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}
  .pain-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  .pain-row input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--blue)}
  .pain-val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;min-width:34px;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 0}
  .save-btn{grid-column:1 / -1;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;padding:13px;font-family:var(--disp);font-size:17px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;cursor:pointer}
  .save-btn:active{opacity:.85}
  .log-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:16px 0 4px}
  .stat-box{background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;text-align:center}
  .stat-box b{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:19px;font-weight:600}
  .stat-box span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .trend{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;height:36px;margin:10px 0 2px}
  .trend div{flex:1;background:var(--blue);border-radius:2px 2px 0 0;min-height:3px;opacity:.85}
  .trend div.hi{background:var(--red)}
  .trend-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .entries{margin-top:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
  .entry{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13px}
  .entry-top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 10px;align-items:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px}
  .entry-top .d{font-weight:600}
  .chip{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:3px}
  .chip.a{background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue)} .chip.b{background:#EFE7FB;color:#7A4FD1} .chip.r{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber)}
  .chip.p{background:#F0F2F5;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .chip.pain-lo{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green)} .chip.pain-md{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber)} .chip.pain-hi{background:var(--red-soft);color:var(--red)}
  .entry .note-txt{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:5px;font-size:12.5px}
  .entry-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
  .entry-actions button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#FAFBFC;border-radius:5px;padding:4px 10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .entry-actions button.flag-on{background:var(--red-soft);border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}
  .entry-actions button.flag-ok{background:var(--green-soft);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green)}
  .log-tools{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
  .log-tools button{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#FAFBFC;border-radius:6px;padding:9px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer}
  .empty-log{text-align:center;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13px;padding:14px 0;font-family:var(--mono)}
  @media (max-width:560px){.log-form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.log-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}

  footer{margin-top:26px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:var(--mono);line-height:1.7}

  @media print{body{background:#fff}.wrap{padding:0}.card,.clock{break-inside:avoid}}
  @media (max-width:560px){
    th:nth-child(4),td:nth-child(4){display:none}
    .seg span{display:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <div class="eyebrow">Systems Board · Return-to-Climb Protocol</div>
  <h1>Knee Recovery Training Plan</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <div>Post-meniscectomy · <b>medial meniscus</b></div>
    <div>Training days <b>5×/week</b> · 2 climb + 3 bike</div>
    <div>Climb A <b>strength &amp; drills</b> · Climb B <b>endurance</b> · Bike <b>ERG mode</b></div>
    <div>Session length <b>~60 min</b></div>
    <div>Duration <b>8 weeks + maintenance</b></div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- WEEKLY LAYOUT -->
<div class="week-nav">
  <div class="start-row">
    <label for="start-date">Plan start</label>
    <input type="date" id="start-date">
    <div class="wkbadge" id="wk-badge">Set start date</div>
  </div>
  <p class="sub" style="margin-top:0">Tap a day to jump to its workout. Bike days slot between climbing days so fingers and knee each get recovery; swap days as needed, but keep 48h+ between the two climbing sessions.</p>
  <div class="week">
    <div class="day"><h6>Mon</h6><div class="act climb-a" data-target="phase">Climb A<small>strength</small></div></div>
    <div class="day"><h6>Tue</h6><div class="act bike" data-target="#ride1">Ride 1<small>Z2 aerobic</small></div></div>
    <div class="day"><h6>Wed</h6><div class="act rest">Rest<small>mobility</small></div></div>
    <div class="day"><h6>Thu</h6><div class="act climb-b" data-target="#endurance">Climb B<small>endurance</small></div></div>
    <div class="day"><h6>Fri</h6><div class="act bike" data-target="#ride2">Ride 2<small>sweet spot</small></div></div>
    <div class="day"><h6>Sat</h6><div class="act bike" data-target="#ride3">Ride 3<small>long Z2</small></div></div>
    <div class="day"><h6>Sun</h6><div class="act rest">Rest<small>full</small></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SESSION CLOCK -->
<div class="clock">
  <h3>Session A Clock — Strength &amp; Drills</h3>
  <div class="bar">
    <div class="seg" style="flex:15;background:#4B5866"><span>Warm-up traverse</span><b>0–15</b></div>
    <div class="seg" style="flex:30;background:#2456E6"><span>Mirrored drills A+B</span><b>15–45</b></div>
    <div class="seg" style="flex:8;background:#1E8A5A"><span>Hangboard</span><b>45–53</b></div>
    <div class="seg" style="flex:7;background:#17202B"><span>Core</span><b>53–60</b></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ticks">
    <div style="flex:15">0:00</div><div style="flex:30">0:15</div><div style="flex:8">0:45</div><div style="flex:7">0:53&nbsp;→&nbsp;1:00</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="clock">
  <h3>Session B Clock — Endurance</h3>
  <div class="bar">
    <div class="seg" style="flex:15;background:#4B5866"><span>Warm-up traverse</span><b>0–15</b></div>
    <div class="seg" style="flex:25;background:#7A4FD1"><span>Endurance block</span><b>15–40</b></div>
    <div class="seg" style="flex:12;background:#2456E6"><span>Light technique drills</span><b>40–52</b></div>
    <div class="seg" style="flex:8;background:#17202B"><span>Core</span><b>52–60</b></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ticks">
    <div style="flex:15">0:00</div><div style="flex:25">0:15</div><div style="flex:12">0:40</div><div style="flex:8">0:52&nbsp;→&nbsp;1:00</div>
  </div>
  <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:8px">No hangboard on Session B — endurance volume already loads the fingers. Technique block = one Block A drill from the current phase at RPE 5.</p>
</div>

<!-- LEGEND -->
<div class="legend">
  <div class="lg ok"><h4>Cleared from Week 1</h4>Static feet under hips, downclimbing, straight-on locks, gastons, underclings, open flags on straight leg.</div>
  <div class="lg cau"><h4>Introduce with caution</h4>Backsteps &amp; outside flags (Wk 4+), shallow drop knees (Wk 7+), high steps above mid-thigh (Wk 5+).</div>
  <div class="lg no"><h4>Avoid until cleared</h4>Heel hooks, knee bars, deep drop knees, dynamic moves, <b>any jump-off or drop</b> — downclimb everything.</div>
</div>

<!-- MOVEMENT KEY -->
<details class="sec" open>
<summary><h2>Movement Key <span class="tag" style="background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue)">Blue = key limb</span></h2></summary>
<p class="sub">Schematic body positions referenced in the drill tables. Dots are systems-grid holds; the blue limb is the one doing the knee-relevant work.</p>
<div class="movekey">

  <div class="mk">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 120 150" role="img" aria-label="Straight-on position, feet under hips">
      <circle class="hold" cx="20" cy="18" r="4"/><circle class="hold" cx="100" cy="18" r="4"/>
      <circle class="hold" cx="20" cy="70" r="4"/><circle class="hold" cx="100" cy="70" r="4"/>
      <circle class="hold" cx="42" cy="134" r="4"/><circle class="hold" cx="78" cy="134" r="4"/>
      <line class="fig" x1="60" y1="60" x2="28" y2="24"/><line class="fig" x1="60" y1="60" x2="92" y2="24"/>
      <line class="fig" x1="60" y1="55" x2="60" y2="90"/>
      <line class="fig-acc" x1="60" y1="90" x2="43" y2="130"/><line class="fig-acc" x1="60" y1="90" x2="77" y2="130"/>
      <circle class="head" cx="60" cy="44" r="8"/>
    </svg>
    <h5>Straight-On</h5>
    <span class="stat ok">Wk 1+</span>
  </div>

  <div class="mk">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 120 150" role="img" aria-label="Downclimbing with control">
      <circle class="hold" cx="20" cy="18" r="4"/><circle class="hold" cx="90" cy="18" r="4"/>
